# Claude Code session state -- must not flip provenance git_dirty
.claude/

# GPU-only diagnostics that live untracked on the VM (probe_mem.py,
# probe_snap2.py). git_dirty comes from `git status --porcelain`, which counts
# untracked files, so leaving these visible stamps git_dirty: true on every
# artifact and makes a run unreproducible from its commit alone --
# docs/MEMSCALE_RESULTS.md section 7. probe_params.py is tracked and unaffected.
probe_mem.py
probe_snap.py
probe_snap2.py
# macOS AppleDouble sidecars, which arrive when a tarball is built on the Mac.
._*
